# Keep development files out of release archives.
#
# `git archive` honors export-ignore, and GitHub builds a release's
# "Source code (zip/tar.gz)" assets with git archive — so anything
# marked here is excluded from what people download from the Releases
# page, while staying tracked in the repository.
#
# The rule must be present in the COMMIT BEING TAGGED, so add or change
# it before cutting the tag, not after.
.gitignore      export-ignore
.gitattributes  export-ignore
.github/        export-ignore
